    "media:imagetext": "EMERGENCY EXIT INFORMATION\nPLEASE ACQUAINT YOURSELVES WITH THE SAFETY FEATURES\nLOCATED ON THIS AIRCRAFT.\nSHOULD IT BE NECESSARY TO\nEVACUATE THE AIRCRAFT BECAUSE OF AN EMERGENCY, THE\nDIAGRAMS BELOW ILLUSTRATE THE NUMBER OF EXITS FOR YOUR\nUSE.\nFRONT\nDOOR EXITS\nDOOR\nEXITS\nTurn handle forward. Push door out to open.\nOVERWING\nWINDOW\nEXITS\nPULL HANDL\nPull handle to inflate\nslide.\nRemove high heel shoes\n-jump into slide\nwith feet up.\nWINDOW EXITS\nREAR\nAUXILIARY\nEXIT\nTAILCONE\nTAILCONE OPERATION\nPull window in and up. Turn window on side\nand throw out.\nTENT\nDoor Handle Operation\nPULL AND TURN\nOPEN\nTailcone Handle\nOperation\nStep out, slide off\nwing.\nMove away from aircraft quickly.\nRotate Handle\nClockwise\n(Or)\nPULLS\nPull Handle And\nLift Door Inward\nPull Handle To\nRemove Tailcone\n(OVER)\nJULY, 1974\n1D1132717-1\n171-1353",
